      "text": "they who lay snare for him who reproves shall be cut off, 2 Ne. 27:31–32. Alma1 was caught in snare, Mosiah 23:9. lawyers of Ammonihah lay snares to catch holy ones of God, Alma 10:17. Zeezrom’s plan was snare of adversary, Alma 12:6. Helaman2 warns of snare set by Lamanites, Alma 56:43. word of God divides asunder all snares of devil, Hel. 3:29. Jaredites lay snares to catch fowls, Ether 2:2.",
